{"id":"500206391","kind":"article","title":"知识工作者对于逐步完善想法往往没有具体方法","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2A9r2zcddVXfxjevj5Nzayhwxr9VuycjxYdz"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"常青笔记 & 知识工作","date":"2022-05-21","updated":"2025-07-24","votes":16,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":598,"keywords":["知识工作","想法发展","常青笔记","洞察力","技能发展"],"summary":"作者指出，知识工作者常靠直觉、临时方法逐步打磨想法，却缺少有目标、可改进的具体流程；他猜测这是因为想法发展不像明显技能那样容易感知进步。文中提出常青笔记或可帮助积累洞见。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/500206391","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"4PeDoSYa\">人们期待专业知识工作者能够创新——即产生有价值的、原创性的见解。如果他们有了一个想法的轮廓，他们具体是怎么花时间逐步完善这个想法的？每个步骤是什么样的？<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4HpeV4MGmbKMWY6oUeci392Z7NAueHJ5WH5p\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">灵感源泉在何方？</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup></p><p data-pid=\"yWn4mr2W\">我的直觉是，大部分知识工作者凭直觉来完善想法，这个过程中会使用隐式的方法，但这些方法没有目标指导，并总是寄希望于真知灼见也许最终会浮现。他们通常会临时性开发一些方法，之后就不再费力去改进这些方法（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5gHroEM2vM2WcKxkdcsCw8qv5tmHSbBVxEb4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">人们通常把技能发展到一个平台期，然后就停下来</a>）。我怀疑这主要是因为这不是一个明显的可改进的技能（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3TLgRqbKq1iQvYNvxenccLPZUuJNB329uwGw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">对进步的直观感知驱动技能发展</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>）。</p><p data-pid=\"wnEVY7ji\">一个可能的解决方案：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6cFzJWgj9vZpnrQsjrZ8yCNREzCTgyFeVZTb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">常青笔记有助于积累洞见</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"Q3AWMrYo\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"698476935\" href=\"#/post/698476935\">§赋能环境、游戏和《启蒙琼林》</a></li><li data-pid=\"WAh9SJY4\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"554203902\" href=\"#/post/554203902\">对进步的直观感知驱动技能发展</a></li><li data-pid=\"9sIMbSuk\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"574272825\" href=\"#/post/574272825\">相比知识工作者，运动员和音乐家会更为严格精细地打磨基本技能</a></li><li data-pid=\"e_v_IxxI\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1929184582483285376\" href=\"#/post/1929184582483285376\">采用朴素方法的练习会让人迅速遭遇瓶颈期</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"EXe-X8pe\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"mCddauJL\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制 <br/>题图：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/92152994\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#百合 百合つめあわせ(キス多め) - betock的插画 - pixiv</a> <br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2A9r2zcddVXfxjevj5Nzayhwxr9VuycjxYdz\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Knowledge workers usually have no specific methods for developing ideas over time (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 灵感源泉在何方？ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"571702216\" href=\"#/post/571702216\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 对进步的直观感知驱动技能发展 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"554203902\" href=\"#/post/554203902\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 常青笔记有助于积累洞见 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"448897897\" href=\"#/post/448897897\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"516086237","title":"使用笔记在内容中建立联系的优缺点","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":11,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 常青笔记 & 知识工作"},{"id":"521211750","title":"文献笔记是次要的和分离的","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":12,"minutes":3,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 常青笔记 & 知识工作"},{"id":"698476935","title":"§赋能环境、游戏和《启蒙琼林》","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":9,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"554203902","title":"对进步的直观感知驱动技能发展","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":8,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"448897897","title":"常青笔记有助于积累洞见","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":23,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[{"id":"3502489179","title":"快乐学习和刻意练习哪个更科学？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":107,"minutes":12,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 107 赞同","evidence":"回答正文有明确指向该译文的知乎内链/链接卡，按直接提及记为1级。"}]}